        "“And his host, and those that were numbered of it, were forty-six thousand and five hundred.”",
        "“And those which pitch by him will be the tribe of Simeon. And the captain of the children of Simeon will be Shelumiel the son of Zurishaddai.”",
        "“And his host, and those that were numbered of them, were fifty-nine thousand and three hundred.”",
        "“Then the tribe of Gad. And the captain of the sons of Gad will be Eliasaph the son of Reuel.”",
        "“And his host, and those that were numbered of them, were forty-five thousand six hundred and fifty.”",
        "“All that were numbered in the camp of Reuben were one hundred and fifty-one thousand four hundred and fifty, throughout their armies. And they will set forth in the second rank.”",
        "“Then the tabernacle of the congregation will set forward with the camp of the Levites in the midst of the camp. As they encamp, so will they set forward, every man in his place by their standards.”",
        "“On the west side will be the standard of the camp of Ephraim according to their armies. And the captain of the sons of Ephraim will be Elishama the son of Ammihud.”",
        "“And his host, and those that were numbered of them, were forty thousand and five hundred.”",
        "“And by him will be the tribe of Manasseh. And the captain of the children of Manasseh will be Gamaliel the son of Pedahzur.”",
