        "And David said to Ahimelech, “And is there not here under your hand spear or sword? for I have neither brought my sword nor my weapons with me, because the king's business required haste.”",
        "And the priest said, “The sword of Goliath the Philistine, whom you killed in the valley of Elah, behold, it is here wrapped in a cloth behind the ephod: if you will take that, take it: for there is no other save that here.” And David said, “There is none like that; give it me.”",
        "And David arose, and fled that day for fear of Saul, and went to Achish the king of Gath.",
