        "But Amasa took no heed to the sword that was in Joab's hand: so he struck him with it in the fifth rib, and shed out his bowels to the ground, and struck him not again; and he died. So Joab and Abishai his brother pursued after Sheba the son of Bichri.",
        "And one of Joab's men stood by him, and said, “He that favors Joab, and he that is for David, let him go after Joab.”",
