        "And he said, “What cities are these which you have given me, my brother?” And he called them the land of Cabul to this day.",
        "And Hiram sent to the king one hundred and twenty talents of gold.",
        "And this is the reason of the levy which king Solomon raised, for to build the house of the Lord, and his own house, and Millo, and the wall of Jerusalem, and Hazor, and Megiddo, and Gezer.",
        "For Pharaoh king of Egypt had gone up, and taken Gezer, and burnt it with fire, and killed the Canaanites that dwelt in the city, and given it for a present to his daughter, Solomon’s wife.",
