        "Now after the time that Amaziah did turn away from following the Lord they made a conspiracy against him in Jerusalem; and he fled to Lachish: but they sent to Lachish after him, and killed him there.",
        "And they brought him upon horses, and buried him with his fathers in the city of Judah."
