        "For I have sworn by Myself, says the Lord, that Bozrah shall become a desolation, a reproach, a waste, and a curse; and all the cities of it shall be perpetual wastes.",
        "I have heard a rumor from the Lord, and an ambassador is sent to the heathen, saying, Gather yourselves together, and come against her, and rise up to the battle.",
        "For, lo, I will make you small among the heathen, and despised among men.",
