        "“Now, you son of man, take up a lamentation for Tyrus;”",
        "“And say to Tyrus, ‘O you that are situated at the entry of the sea, which are a merchant of the people for many isles, Thus says the Lord God; O Tyrus, you have said, I am of perfect beauty.’”",
