        "“‘And I will pour out My indignation upon you, I will blow against you in the fire of My wrath, and deliver you into the hand of brutish men, and skillful to destroy.’”",
        "“‘You shall be for fuel to the fire; your blood shall be in the midst of the land; you shall be no more remembered: for I the Lord have spoken it.’”"
